1
00:00:28,088 --> 00:00:39,451
I came home.

2
00:00:42,850 --> 00:00:54,134
I'm leaving home early tomorrow morning.
I'm going to travel to Taiwan.

3
00:00:57,960 --> 00:01:07,379
It's my first trip abroad in a long time.
I have a lot of worries about this and that, and I have a lot of luggage.

4
00:01:18,116 --> 00:01:26,980
When I think that I will be away from Japan for a while
The menu for the evening meal was quickly decided 😚.

5
00:01:32,076 --> 00:01:43,241
I'll just cook rice first

6
00:02:15,158 --> 00:02:23,902
I'm going to eat the tea I'm about to drink and
I'm going to try some of the snacks that I got from my friend.

7
00:02:30,185 --> 00:02:37,660
I need to catch my breath before I move🤭

8
00:02:45,681 --> 00:02:54,902
Crackers that when I crack them open, a toy comes out.
they are cute and taste like brown sugar!

9
00:03:27,048 --> 00:03:37,062
I'm going to change comfortably and make a meal

10
00:03:58,297 --> 00:04:06,526
I bought only what I could freeze

11
00:04:48,639 --> 00:04:58,732
Frozen tobiko
I pour cooking sake over it and let it thaw.

12
00:05:12,291 --> 00:05:20,000
Eggs with a pinch of salt and a pinch of mirin

13
00:06:27,211 --> 00:06:33,139
(I need to sharpen my knife 😹)

14
00:06:51,125 --> 00:06:59,869
I heard that if I shake the green onions in the middle
so they don't stick together.

15
00:07:00,286 --> 00:07:09,291
Sashimi🐟 is the main dish before leaving Japan.
It was cheap at the right time!

16
00:07:10,280 --> 00:07:17,398
I marinate it in soy sauce

17
00:07:22,186 --> 00:07:31,446
Miso soup for the night and the next morning

18
00:07:38,660 --> 00:07:45,421
I made tofu with mushrooms and an egg I had in the fridge

19
00:07:57,854 --> 00:08:08,661
I freeze the rest of the mushrooms.
I think it tastes better frozen 😊.

20
00:08:24,690 --> 00:08:32,363
I shake the green onions while I open the freezer...

21
00:08:55,957 --> 00:09:06,368
2 tablespoons vinegar, 1 tablespoon sugar, 1 teaspoon salt (for 1 cup of rice)

22
00:09:14,054 --> 00:09:23,473
The rest of the rice is also frozen

23
00:09:30,849 --> 00:09:44,910
The rice and sashimi are delicious as is, 
but I decided to make a nori roll so that I can eat it tomorrow morning.

24
00:09:50,573 --> 00:10:04,872
Two sheets of nori and all the ingredients are rolled up into a spiral sushi roll.

25
00:10:31,257 --> 00:10:44,762
The recipe calls for two rollers.
I only have one, so I try to roll it up somehow😅

26
00:11:43,932 --> 00:11:53,629
Maybe it's because I couldn't wait and cut it right after rolling it up

27
00:11:55,601 --> 00:12:04,703
It was easy to fall apart.
Next time I'll wait longer and cut it into pieces 😹.

28
00:12:27,513 --> 00:12:37,963
I'm going to be away from home for a while.
I'll pack up the trash.

29
00:13:31,658 --> 00:13:42,981
I'm going to pack a lot of stuff.

30
00:14:02,315 --> 00:14:12,607
Dorayaki and Okaki
I'm going to bring a set of sweet and savory snacks

31
00:14:15,919 --> 00:14:23,751
In Taiwan we were treated very kindly

32
00:14:26,633 --> 00:14:36,488
I was saved many times by kindness.
These were helpful at such times!

33
00:14:58,820 --> 00:15:07,763
I got about 4 hours of sleep 😅

34
00:15:34,410 --> 00:15:45,138
After I do my makeup.
I put the last piece of luggage, the makeup pouch, in my suitcase

35
00:15:48,126 --> 00:15:55,522
I bought a case of sponges

36
00:15:58,193 --> 00:16:06,382
I've always been curious about this pouch, too

37
00:16:45,804 --> 00:16:55,319
I'm going to Narita Airport by bus

38
00:17:32,129 --> 00:17:40,278
Checking in and checking luggage.
I can't believe it's all done by machine without having to talk to a staff member... 😳

39
00:17:42,169 --> 00:17:51,191
Just to be safe, I got some anti-sickness medicine and a lip balm that I forgot.

40
00:17:54,406 --> 00:18:02,238
My last Japanese meal was takoyaki🐙.

41
00:19:00,344 --> 00:19:02,344
👋🙇🏻

42
00:19:09,525 --> 00:19:16,048
The beginning of the four-hour flight to Taiwan

43
00:19:20,198 --> 00:19:27,871
(Fuji really sticking its head above the clouds...)

44
00:19:36,658 --> 00:19:46,553
When the city comes into view
It reminds me of Kiki from the Witch's Delivery Service🤭🧹.

45
00:19:49,126 --> 00:19:54,260
I'm fidgeting as we get closer to our arrival

46
00:20:22,447 --> 00:20:28,018
Hello, Taiwan

47
00:20:35,881 --> 00:20:48,513
I'm a bit nervous about immigration and so on.
I've done some prep work online, so even though it's my first time, the flow lines look familiar... 😂

48
00:20:54,733 --> 00:21:04,311
Safely out to the arrival hall.
I'll join until the campaign in Taiwan

49
00:21:07,023 --> 00:21:16,759
I won the prize.
I received about 20,000 yen worth of electronic money🥺💗💗.

50
00:21:19,646 --> 00:21:31,326
My mother is arriving on a different plane.
I'm moving to different arrival terminals

51
00:21:46,451 --> 00:21:57,179
This layover was the most uncomfortable point of this trip 😂

52
00:21:59,595 --> 00:22:10,561
We met up safely.
We have a quick lu lohan at the airport food court (very tasty!)

53
00:22:11,307 --> 00:22:15,251
I also get some dumplings from my mother

54
00:22:17,533 --> 00:22:25,365
Using the electronic money I got from the campaign
I'm going to Taipei station.

55
00:22:41,712 --> 00:22:50,536
My first time in Taiwan, everything looks so new to me.

56
00:23:03,489 --> 00:23:15,288
On the way to the cab stand
A children's clothing shop that captured our heart

57
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:38,665
Everyone was line, so I'm going to buy some right away

58
00:23:41,648 --> 00:23:54,994
The driver is teaching us many things in Japanese on the way to the hotel😹💗

59
00:24:01,697 --> 00:24:07,030
📍W TAIPEI Hotel

60
00:24:11,236 --> 00:24:22,758
We put away luggage and change clothes.

61
00:24:24,939 --> 00:24:33,326
I was worried about rain.
We decided to go to the night market

62
00:24:46,376 --> 00:24:52,542
Raohe Street Night Market

63
00:24:56,469 --> 00:25:05,531
The owner who graciously took my picture.
I can't forget the deliciousness 🤤💗

64
00:25:30,483 --> 00:25:38,910
If I didn't have an umbrella I think I could have tried more different foods

65
00:25:40,599 --> 00:25:50,296
The raindrops and the colorful streets were really beautiful.
We enjoyed walking everywhere.

66
00:25:54,894 --> 00:26:03,718
I found myself walking close to my hotel🤭.

67
00:26:07,192 --> 00:26:12,961
📍yipinprawn

68
00:26:14,174 --> 00:26:19,784
I was passing by a shrimp restaurant

69
00:26:22,864 --> 00:26:28,474
Pepper-flavored shrimp in a jar

70
00:26:30,001 --> 00:26:38,031
We've talked about how delicious it is so many times with my mother after back to Japan.
We both loved this restaurant 🤭💛

71
00:26:40,779 --> 00:26:50,317
Day 1 ends with an exploration of convenience stores!

72
00:27:12,182 --> 00:27:20,927
I immediately report back to my nieces📲

73
00:27:29,469 --> 00:27:34,364
I'm here for breakfast

74
00:27:37,146 --> 00:27:47,104
We even enjoyed something unique to Taiwan🤭.

75
00:27:56,225 --> 00:28:02,668
I'm going to visit Taipei 101

76
00:28:09,680 --> 00:28:22,154
I'm on the 88th floor.
When I come near the window, I can barely see.

77
00:28:26,775 --> 00:28:31,711
Simple Kaffa Sola

78
00:28:33,821 --> 00:28:43,676
Coffee time with my mother talked leisurely ☕.
The latte was very good!

79
00:28:53,654 --> 00:28:57,796
📍Shin Yeh

80
00:29:00,115 --> 00:29:06,598
Crab Okowa
I love it with crab vinegar 🤤.

81
00:29:12,467 --> 00:29:21,172
We were going to go to Jiufang, but it was raining so hard that I had to change my plans.

82
00:29:28,662 --> 00:29:35,145
I'm getting used to this train

83
00:29:47,166 --> 00:29:52,300
📍Dihua Street

84
00:29:54,944 --> 00:30:01,387
We are now on a wholesale street called Dihua Street

85
00:30:05,672 --> 00:30:13,266
We casually enter a cafe.
There is a nice courtyard at the back of the store... 😳

86
00:30:22,388 --> 00:30:29,506
A fluffy friend  wanders in and shows up 🐶.

87
00:30:31,612 --> 00:30:38,095
The moment my heart was stolen... 😂💕

88
00:30:45,340 --> 00:30:54,481
Everywhere I looked, the atmosphere was wonderful.
I even liked the air that flowed 🤭💗.

89
00:31:12,468 --> 00:31:18,197
I can't help but stop by the drink stand 🥤 when I find it

90
00:31:25,405 --> 00:31:32,007
Back to the hotel early and enjoy the end of the second day

91
00:31:55,360 --> 00:32:00,000
📍Huashan 1914 Creative Park

92
00:32:01,506 --> 00:32:10,330
Renovated factory site
It was like stepping into a movie world.

93
00:32:13,347 --> 00:32:18,997
1 drink a day

94
00:32:21,994 --> 00:32:28,874
I strolled around, bought some souvenirs.
I headed to the airport early

95
00:32:43,690 --> 00:32:50,768
I don't remember the name of it.
The burgers and fries were delicious!

96
00:32:53,078 --> 00:32:59,799
In preparation for an early morning flight the next day
We decided to stay at a capsule hotel at the airport

97
00:33:04,345 --> 00:33:13,010
When the day changes, it's my mother's birthday
I'm going to put a message card on her pillow 🤭.

98
00:33:15,329 --> 00:33:28,913
Happy Birthday and
A message of sorry and thank you for a journey that turned out to be a random one 😂.

99
00:33:46,174 --> 00:33:54,085
My mother and I were in different terminals again.
We woke up and split up in a flurry.

100
00:34:03,465 --> 00:34:12,289
When I got to the boarding gate, the terminals were connected and I was reunited with my mother... lol

101
00:34:15,649 --> 00:34:23,164
Finally, we got a nice surprise from the airport.
We each headed home✈.

102
00:34:28,338 --> 00:34:34,900
Enjoying a cup of tea with tea leaves bought at the airport.

103
00:34:46,131 --> 00:34:54,360
On the way back to Japan in no time

104
00:34:56,650 --> 00:35:03,292
It was hot in Taiwan, but
I feel like summer is starting in Japan, too.

105
00:35:12,737 --> 00:35:27,353
I have to return my rented suitcase.
I didn't have to put off unpacking 🤭.

106
00:36:11,758 --> 00:36:21,137
I took a nap and woke up hungry.
I decided to try some instant noodles I bought at the airport

107
00:36:39,587 --> 00:36:50,275
And the plants that I was worried about seem to be okay

108
00:36:53,068 --> 00:37:02,804
It looks like I should cut the flower buds off the parsley.
I cut them off and put them on display

109
00:37:20,405 --> 00:37:26,769
Walnuts or not walnuts

110
00:37:46,302 --> 00:37:52,111
I sauteed mushrooms with salt

111
00:37:58,977 --> 00:38:06,531
1 teaspoon soy sauce, balsamic vinegar to taste, walnuts

112
00:38:17,314 --> 00:38:25,582
Mushroom marinade that can be served cold or hot.

113
00:38:30,535 --> 00:38:37,018
An aroma that reminds me of Taiwan the moment I open the bag

114
00:38:50,691 --> 00:38:57,611
Topped with green onions, nuts and egg yolk

115
00:39:38,517 --> 00:39:45,556
I had a recommendation for the noodle, but I couldn't go...

116
00:39:49,089 --> 00:39:57,595
I remember afterwards what I didn't eat and where I couldn't go

117
00:40:11,404 --> 00:40:21,616
I'll try to taste it as soon as I can.
I'll have to sort out the souvenirs later.

118
00:40:34,651 --> 00:40:47,879
I'm going to make a souvenir set with a variety of flavors.
(I'll have to try them one by one to🤭)

119
00:40:54,493 --> 00:41:03,595
I've been treated so kindly by so many people on this trip.
I am very grateful!

120
00:41:06,268 --> 00:41:16,718
They gave me directions without asking.
And when I didn't understand the language, they would tell me in different ways.

121
00:41:20,000 --> 00:41:27,277
I wanted to be able to make people who are traveling in Japan feel the same way.

122
00:41:32,274 --> 00:41:43,002
I bought an all-purpose oil that is good for burns, headaches, stiff shoulders, motion sickness, etc.

123
00:41:57,818 --> 00:42:11,839
A nostalgic scent
I immediately put it on my mosquito bites... lol

124
00:42:15,746 --> 00:42:24,848
This has been a very uncoordinated travel VLOG😢
Thank you for watching to the end!

